cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "SymplecticGKP"
abstract: >-
  Pure-Julia tools for multi-mode Gottesman–Kitaev–Preskill (GKP) codes:
  integer symplectic canonical forms, invariant-factor balancing, a
  dimension-reduction pipeline turning classical low-density lattice codes into
  single-qubit GKP codes, and distance / logical-error-probability (Voronoi)
  computations.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arzani
    given-names: Francesco
  - family-names: Hillmann
    given-names: Timo
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/frarzani/SymplecticGKP.jl"
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Quantum low-density lattice codes"
    authors:
